\'t load the add-ons list. It\'s probably an issue on our side, please try to come back in few minutes.'=>'A kò lè kó àkójọ àwọn àfikún náà jáde. Ó ṣe é ṣe kí ìṣòro náà wà lọ́dọ̀ wa, jọ̀wọ́ gbiyanju láti padà wá lẹ́yìn ìṣẹ́jú díẹ̀.','Add-On'=>'Fi kún-un','%s is a premium only add-on. You have to purchase a license first before activating the plugin.'=>'%s jẹ àfikún tí ó ní iye lórí nìkan. O ní láti rà ìwé-àṣẹ kan ní àkọ́kọ́ kí o tó mú kí àfikún náà ṣiṣẹ́.','%s Add-on was successfully purchased.'=>'A ti ra %s Add-on ni aṣeyọri.','Your %s Add-on plan was successfully upgraded.'=>'Aṣayan %s Add-on rẹ ti ni ilọsiwaju ni aṣeyọri.','%s free trial was successfully cancelled. Since the add-on is premium only it was automatically deactivated. If you like to use it in the future, you\'ll have to purchase a license.'=>'Àpilẹ̀kọ ọ̀fẹ́ %s ti fagile ní àṣeyọrí. Nítorí pé add-on náà jẹ́ ti ètò ọ̀rẹ́-òfẹ́ nìkan, wọ́n pa á rẹ́ fún ìgbà díẹ̀ fún ara rẹ̀. Bí o bá fẹ́ lò ó ní ọjọ́ iwájú, o ní láti ra ìwé-àṣẹ kan.','addonX cannot run...%s cannot run without the plugin.'=>'%s kò lè ṣiṣẹ́ láìsí afikún náà.','addonX cannot run without pluginY%1$s cannot run without %2$s.'=>'%1$s kò lè ṣiṣẹ́ láìní %2$s.','Just letting you know that the add-ons information of %s is being pulled from an external server.'=>'Mo n kan fún ọ ní létí pé a n fa ìwífún àwọn àfikún ti %s láti ojú òpó wẹ́bù ìta.','Add Ons of module %s'=>'Àwọn àfikún ti mòdùlù %s','Address Line %d'=>'Adirẹẹsi %d','Affiliate'=>'Alábàṣẹpọ̀','Due to violation of our affiliation terms, we decided to temporarily block your affiliation account. If you have any questions, please contact support.'=>'Nitori ilodi si awọn ilana ajọṣepọ wa, a ti pinnu lati dènà akọọlẹ ajọṣepọ rẹ fun igba diẹ. Ti o ba ni ibeere kankan, jọwọ kan si ẹgbẹ atilẹyin.','Your affiliation account was temporarily suspended.'=>'A ti fi àkọọlẹ ìsopọ̀ rẹ sílẹ̀ fún ìgbà díẹ̀.','Your affiliate application for %1$s has been accepted! Log in to your affiliate area at: %2$s.'=>'