'Wo awọn ètò Pro ati awọn owo rẹ','Front-end output'=>'Abajade iwaju-ipari','Class name prefix'=>'Àlẹ̀mọ́ orúkọ kílàsì','Every class name the plugin prints on your pages starts with this prefix, so the pages do not reveal which plugin built them. 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'Gbogbo orúkọ kilásì tí plọ́gìnnì náà tẹ̀ jáde sórí ojú ewé rẹ bẹ̀rẹ̀ pẹ̀lú àfikún yìí, kí àwọn ojú ewé náà má bàa fi hàn pé èwo ni plọ́gìnnì tí ó kọ́ wọn. Lédè tàbí nọ́mbà kékeré 1 sí 8, tí ó bẹ̀rẹ̀ pẹ̀lú lẹ́tà kan.','Save'=>'Fi pamọ́','Beta updates'=>'Àwọn ohun ìgbàlejò tí wọ́n ṣẹ̀ṣẹ̀ ń dánwò','This site receives beta versions as updates.'=>'Ojula itanna yii n gba awọn ẹya beta gẹgẹ bi imudojuiwọn.','This site receives stable versions only.'=>'Ojula yii n gba awọn ẹya iduro nikan.','Change this on the Account page'=>'Yi eyi pada sori oju-iwe Akawunti','Beta versions are offered to licensed Pro installations that are connected to their account. Once connected, you can join from the Account page.'=>'Awon ẹya beta ni a n fún awọn fifi sori ẹrọ Pro ti o ni iwe-ašẹ ti o si ni asopọ si akọọlẹ wọn. Ni kete ti o ba ni asopọ, o le darapọ mọ lati oju-iwe Akọọlẹ.','The request converting this post stopped before it finished, so the post was skipped. Open it to convert it, or convert it again from here.'=>'Ìbéèrè fún yíyí àpilẹ̀kọ yìí padà dáwọ́ dúró kí ó tó parí, nítorí náà a fò á kọjá. Ṣí i láti yí i padà, tàbí kí o tún yí i padà láti ibi yìí.','There is no backup of this post to restore.'=>'Ko si afẹyinti ifiweranṣẹ yii lati mu pada sipo.','The converted content could not be saved.'=>'A kò lè fi àwọn ohun tí a yí padà sí pamọ́.','Unknown error.'=>'Àṣìṣe àìmọ̀.','No legacy content has been checked yet.'=>'Àכו́nù ìصàìnìì tí a ti ṣe àyèwò fún kò tìì wà.','Restoring legacy content: %1$d of %2$d posts.'=>'Mu ohun ti a jogun pada: %1$d ninu %2$d awọn ifiweranṣẹ.','Converting legacy content: %1$d of %2$d posts.'=>'Yí akópawé atijọ padà: %1$d nínú %2$d àwọn àfikún.','Undo finished: %1$d restored, %2$d failed.'=>'Ìṣẹ̀dá padà parí: %1$d ti padà bọ̀ sípò, %2$d kùnà.','Conversion finished: %1$d converted, %2$d unchanged, %3$d failed.'=>'Ìyípadà parí: %1$d ti yí padà, %2$d kò yí padà, %3$d kùnà.','Legacy content'=>'Akoonu atijọ','Pages made with earlier versions of Page Builder Sandwich are converted to blocks in the background. Every post is backed up first, so each conversion can be undone.'=>'Awọn ojú-ewé tí a fi àwọn ẹ̀yà Page Builder Sandwich tẹ́lẹ̀ṣẹ̀ ṣe ni a ń yí padà sí àwọn blọọku lẹ́yìn. A ṣe àfikún afẹ́yinti fún gbogbo post ní àkọ́kọ́, nitorinaa a le da ìyípadà kọ̀ọ̀kan padà.','%d post still holds legacy content.'=>'Fífọ́kànsì %d ṣì ní àkóովé àtijọ́ nínú.','%d post has a backup.'=>'%d post ni afẹyinti kan.','%d post could not be handled'=>'Kò ṣeé ṣe láti ṣe àkóso àpilẹ̀kọ %d kan','Post %d'=>'Ifihan %d','Conversion started. It continues in the background; you can leave this page.'=>'Ìyípadà bẹ̀rẹ̀. Ó ń tẹ̀ síwájú ní ẹ̀yìn; o le kúrò lórí ojú-ewé yìí.','Convert legacy content'=>'Yi akoonu atijọ pada','Restore every converted post to its legacy content? Changes made to those posts since they were converted will be lost.'=>'Ṣe àtúnṣe gbogbo àpilẹ̀kọ tí a ti yí padà sí ohun àlùmọ́ni wọn tẹ́lẹ̀? Àwọn àtúnṣe tí a ṣe sí àwọn àpilẹ̀kọ yẹn láti ìgbà tí a ti yí wọn padà yóò sọnù.','Undo started. It continues in the background; you can leave this page.'=>'Ìṣẹ̀dá sẹ́yìn bẹ̀rẹ̀. Ó ń tẹ̀ síwájú ní ẹ̀yìn; o le kúrò ní ojú ewé yìí.','Undo all conversions'=>'Pa gbogbo iyipada rẹ kuro','Shortcode tag'=>'Àmì kékeré fún ìlà kíkúrú','Use letters, numbers, dashes and underscores only.'=>'Lo lẹta, nọmba, àmì iyọkuro ati àmì abẹlẹ nikan.','Attribute name'=>'Orúkọ ànímọ́','Add attribute'=>'Fi àfikún kún un','Content'=>'Akoonu','Shortcode'=>'Koodu Kúrúsì','Choose a shortcode tag in the block settings.'=>'Yan ami aami kukuru kan ninu awọn eto bulọọki naa.','The "%s" control from the old editor is not available in the block editor. Enter the value as text.'=>'Ìṣàkóso "%s" láti inú olootu àtijọ́ kò sí ní olootu bọ́lọ́kì náà. Tẹ iye náà sínú gẹ́gẹ́ bí ọ̀rọ̀.','Choose image'=>'Yan àwòrán','Choose file'=>'Yan fáìlì','— Default —'=>'— Aiyipada —','Advanced styling'=>'Ìlànà aṣọ tó ga julọ','Inline CSS'=>'CSS Abẹnu','CSS declarations, for example: min-height: 380px; background-color: #333'=>'Àwọn ìkéde CSS, fún àpẹrẹ: min-height: 380px; background-color: #333','Effects (legacy classes)'=>'Àwọn ipa (àwọn kíláìsì ìṣẹ̀dá àtijọ́)','Space-separated effect names carried over from older versions, for example: hover-shadow'=>'Àwọn orúkọ ipa tí a pín nípa lílo àlàfo tí ó wá láti àwọn ẹ̀dà àtijọ́, fún àpẹẹrẹ: hover-shadow','Row'=>'Ahọnni','Width'=>'Ìbú','Content width'=>'Ìgbòòrò àkóónú','Full width'=>'Gbogbo iwọn','Full width, content kept in the middle'=>'Fífẹ̀ kíkún, a pa àwọn àkóónú mọ́ láàárín','Link'=>'So pọ̀ọ̀kùn','Link address'=>'Àdírẹ́sì ìjápọ̀','Open in a new tab'=>'Ṣíṣí ní taabu tuntun kan','Link relationship'=>'Asiko idapo awon oju-opona','Alignment'=>'Àgbékalẹ̀','None'=>'Kankan','Left'=>'Apa osi','Centre'=>'Àárín','Right'=>'Ọtún','Button text'=>'Ọrọ bọtini','Add text…'=>'Fi ọrọ kun…','Icon'=>'Àmì','SVG markup'=>'Àmì SVG','Scripts, links and external references are removed before the icon is shown.'=>'Awon afiwe, awon isopọ ati awon itọka ita ni a ma n yọ kuro ki a to fi aami naa han.','Accessible label'=>'Àmìwò ẹ̀rọ alábòójútó tí ó ṣeé wọlé','Leave empty for a decorative icon.'=>'Fi sílẹ̀ láìsí nǹkankan fún àmì ìṣọ́ṣọ́.','Paste SVG markup in the block settings.'=>'Fi ami SVG sinu awọn eto bulọọki.','New setting name'=>'Orúkọ ètò tuntun','For example: title or text'=>'Fún àpẹẹrẹ: àkọlé tàbí ọrọ̀','Add setting'=>'Fi ètò kun','Widget'=>'Wíjẹ̀tì','Choose a widget'=>'Yan wiṣeti kan','Widget area'=>'Agbegbe Wigi','Choose a widget area'=>'Yan agbegbe fídíìítì kan','This image has no width and height, so the page will jump when it loads. Choose it from the Media Library, or set its width and height.'=>'Àwòrán yìí kò ní ìbú tàbí gíga, nítorí náà ojú ìwé náà yóò fò nígbà tí ó bá ń kó. Yan án láti inú Àkójọ Àwòrán, tàbí kí o ṣètò ìbú àti gíga rẹ̀.','This video is not from the Media Library, so its size is unknown and the page will jump when it loads. Upload it to the Media Library instead.'=>'Fidio yìí kò wá láti Ilé Ìkópamọ́ Àwòrán, nítorí náà a kò mọ ìwọ̀n rẹ̀, ojú ewé náà yóò sì fó lọ sókè nígbà tí ó bá ń kó. Ṣe àgbéṣọ rẹ̀ sí Ilé Ìkópamọ́ Àwòrán dípò bẹ́ẹ̀.','An image, video or frame in this HTML has no width and height, so the page will jump when it loads. Add width and height attributes to it.'=>'Àwòrán, fídíò tàbí fífírù kankan nínú HTML yìí kò ní ìbú àti gíga, nítorí náà ojú ewé náà yóò fò nígbà tí ó bá ń kó. Fi àwọn àbùdá ìbú àti gíga kún un.','This embed resizes itself after it loads, which moves the content below it. Give it room or place it lower on the page.'=>'Èké yìí ń tún iwọn ara rẹ̀ ṣe lẹ́yìn tí ó bá gbé wọlé, èyí tí ó ń gbe àwọn ohun inú tó wà ní ìsàlẹ̀ rẹ̀ kúrò ní ipò. Fún ní àyè tàbí gbé e sí ìsàlẹ̀ diẹ lórí ojú ewé náà.','Layout shift'=>'Yiyipada Iṣeto','Heading'=>'Orí-ọ̀rọ̀','Text'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀','Style'=>'Àwòrán Ìrísí','Plain'=>'Wọn','Accent'=>'Ìfihàn èdè','No languages to switch between. The switcher appears when a translation plugin lists two or more languages.'=>'Ko si awọn ede ti o le yipada laarin wọn. Oluyipada naa yoo han nigbati afikun itumọ ba ṣe at তালিকা ede meji tabi ju bẹẹ lọ.','Switcher'=>'Olùyípadà','Show the current language'=>'Fi ede lọwọlọwọ hàn','%s is also editing this page. Saving may overwrite their changes.'=>'%s náà tún ń ṣe àtúnṣe ojú ewé yìí. Ìpamọ́ lè sọ àwọn àtúnṣe wọn di asán.','Block library'=>'Ilé kíkọ àwọn ohun tí a dènà','Layers'=>'Àwọn ìpele','Close panel'=>'Pa pátákì náà','Page canvas'=>'Ojú ìwé fọ́nrán','Revisions'=>'Àwọn àtúnṣe','Block settings'=>'Àwọn ètò ìdènà','Add block: %s'=>'Fi bulọọki kun: %s','(no title)'=>'(kò sí àkọlé)','Open in Studio: %s'=>'Ṣí nínú Studio: %s','Undo'=>'Fagile mo','Redo'=>'Tun se','Show or hide layers'=>'Fi han tabi tọ́ fẹlẹfẹlẹ','Show or hide the block library'=>'Fi hàn tàbí pa ile ikawe bulọọki mọ','Show revisions'=>'Fi awọn atunyẹwo han','Open the normal editor'=>'Ṣii olùṣatunṣo déédéé','Keyboard shortcuts'=>'Àwọn ọ̀nà àbájọ bọ́tìnnì tẹlifóònù','Preview: desktop'=>'Ayẹwo: kọmputa tabili','Preview: tablet'=>'Àwòrán Àkọ́kọ́: tábìlì','Preview: mobile'=>'Àpẹẹrẹ: mobile','Copy style of the selected block'=>'Ṣe àwọn àṣà àti ìrísí ohun tí o ti yàn lẹ́gbẹ̀ẹ́','Paste style onto the selected block'=>'Lẹ́ mọ́ sórí blọ́kì tí a yàn','Copy the selected section'=>'Da apakan ti a yan n’ṣe','Paste a copied section'=>'Lẹ̀ mọ́ apá kan tí a dá se ẹ̀dọ̀kọ̀wé','Turn off safe mode'=>'Pa ipo ailewu rẹ kuro','Turn on safe mode (other plugins off, for you, in Studio only)'=>'Tan ipo aabo (awọn afikun miiran pa, fun ọ, ni Studio nikan)','Published'=>'Ti tẹjade','Scheduled'=>'A ti ṣètò rẹ̀','Pending review'=>'Wọ́n ń ṣe àyẹ̀wò rẹ̀','Private'=>'Ikọọkan','Draft'=>'Àkọpamọ́','All changes saved'=>'Gbogbo ayipada ti wa ni ipamọ','Saving…'=>'Ìpamọ́ lọ́wọ́…','Autosaving…'=>'Ìfipamọ́ fúnra rẹ̀…','Unsaved changes'=>'Àwọn àyípadà tí kò tíì fipamọ́','autosaved'=>'ti a fipamọ laifọwọyi','Desktop preview'=>'Ayẹwo oju opo wẹẹmu lori kọmputa tabili','Tablet preview'=>'Àwòrán àkọkọ ti tábìlì','Mobile preview'=>'Ààyè àwòrán fún fóònù alágbèékùn','Studio toolbar'=>'Ọpa irinṣẹ Studio','Back to the normal editor'=>'Pad bẹ sí olùṣàtúnṣe déédéé','Page title'=>'Akọlé ojú-ewé','Preview width'=>'Iwọn awotẹlẹ','Command palette'=>'Paleti àṣẹ','View page (opens in a new tab)'=>'Wo ojú-ewé náà (ó ṣí ní tàbù tuntun kan)','Save draft'=>'Fipamọ iwe afọwọkọ','Publish'=>'Tẹjade','Restore unsaved changes?'=>'Ṣe o fẹ́ mú àwọn àyípadà tí kò tíì fipamọ́ padà bọ̀ sípò?','This page has changes that were never saved. They were kept in this browser:'=>'Ojú-ewé yìí ní àwọn àtúnṣe tí kò tíì fipamọ́ rí. A tọ́jú wọn sínú aṣàwákiri yìí:','This page has a newer autosave than the saved version:'=>'Ojúewé yìí ní ìpamọ́ àràǹgbá tó tuntun ju ẹ̀yà tó ti dáná sílẹ̀ lọ:','Restore unsaved changes'=>'Mu awọn ayipada ti a ko fipamọ bọ sipọ','Discard'=>'Pa tì','Revisions could not be loaded.'=>'Àwọn àtúnṣe kò lè kó àwọn wọlé.','Revision restored. Save to keep it, or undo to go back.'=>'Àtúnṣe ti padà bọ̀ sípò. Ṣe ìpamọ́ láti tọ́jú rẹ̀, tàbí kí o fagile láti padà sẹ́yìn.','Close revisions'=>'Pa awọn atunyẹwo kuro','No revisions yet. Each save makes one.'=>'Ko si àtúnyẹwò kankan síbẹ̀. Ìpamọ́ kọ̀ọ̀kan máa ń ṣẹ̀dá ọ̀kan.','Revision from %s'=>'Àtúnyẹ̀wẹ̀ láti ọwọ́ %s','Restore this revision'=>'Muu àtúnṣe yìí bọ̀ sípò','Safe mode could not be changed.'=>'A kò lè yí ipò àìléwu padà.','Safe mode is on.'=>'Ipo ailewu wa ni titan.','%d other plugin is switched off, for you and in Sandwich Studio only. The live site and other users are not affected.'=>'%d àfikọ̀ tòótọ́ míràn ti pa, fún ọ àti ní Sandwich Studio nìkan. Ojú-wẹ́bù wíwà alààyè àti àwọn olùṣe mìíràn kò ní ipa kankan.','Safe mode: switch other plugins off in Studio, for you only'=>'Modo ailewu: pa àwọn àfikún yòókù ní Studio, fún ìwọ nìkan','Safe mode'=>'Ipo aabo','Save your changes.'=>'Fipamọ awọn ayipada rẹ.','Undo your last change.'=>'Pa iyipada rẹ ti o kẹhin kuro.','Redo your last undo.'=>'Tun ṣe iṣẹ afipamọ rẹ to kẹhin.','Show or hide the layers panel.'=>'Fi hàn tàbí fi pa pálẹ̀ kíkún sẹ́hìn.','Display these keyboard shortcuts.'=>'Fi awọn ọna abuja kiibọọju wọnyi han.','Select a block first.'=>'Yan bulọọki kan ni akọkọ.','Style copied. Paste it onto any block, on this site or another.'=>'Aṣọ tii daakọ. Lẹẹmọ sori eyikeyi bulọọki, lori aaye yii tabi omiran.','The browser refused to copy.'=>'Ẹ̀rọ àwárí kò jẹ́ kó ṣe ẹ̀dà.','Section copied. Paste it into any page, on this site or another.'=>'A ti da apakan naa. Ṣe lẹẹmọ rẹ sinu eyikeyi oju-iwe, lori aaye yii tabi omiran.','The clipboard does not hold a style copied from Sandwich Studio.'=>'Ko si àṣà tí a dá kọ̀ sí orí clipboard láti Sandwich Studio.','Style pasted onto %d block.'=>'Àwoṣe ti a lẹ̀ mọ́ori bọ́ọ̀lu %d.','That style does not fit the selected block.'=>'Ara yẹn kò bá bọ́ síi pẹ̀lú bọ́ọ̀kì tí a yan.','The clipboard does not hold a copied section.'=>'Pátì kọ́ọ̀bù náà kò ní apá kan tí a dá.','Section pasted.'=>'A ti lẹ apakan na.','Paste style'=>'Fi aṣa pamọ','Paste section'=>'Ṣẹ́gun abala','Press Ctrl+V (or Cmd+V on a Mac) here to paste'=>'Tẹ Ctrl+V (tabi Cmd+V lori Mac) nibi lati lẹ mọ́ ọn','Copy style'=>'Da aṣa kọọkan','Copy section'=>'Ṣàkọ́ ìpín náà','Edit in Sandwich Studio'=>'Ṣàtúnṣe nínú Sandwich Studio','Saving failed. Check your connection and try again; your changes are kept in this browser.'=>'Ìpamọ́ kùnà. Ṣàyẹ̀wò ìsopọ̀ rẹ kí o sì tún gbiyanju lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i; a ti pa àwọn àtúnṣe rẹ mọ́ sínú aṣàwákiri yìí.','Published.'=>'Ti a tẹjade.','Saved.'=>'A ti fipamọ.','block titleButton link'=>'Ọna asopọ bọtini','block descriptionA link styled as a button.'=>'Ọna aṣopọ kan tí a ṣe bí bọtìnì.','block keywordbutton'=>'bọtìnì','block keywordlink'=>'ọna asopọ','block keywordcall to action'=>'pè láti ṣe ohun kan','block titleColumn'=>'Kọlọmọ','block descriptionA column inside a row. It can hold any block.'=>'KỌLÙMÙ kan laarin rọ́wọ́ kan. O le gbe eyikeyi bulọọki mu.','block keywordcolumn'=>'kọlọmù','block keywordlayout'=>'èdè ojú-iṣẹ́','block titleLanguage switcher (sample)'=>'Ayipada ede (àpeẹrẹ)','block descriptionLists the site\'s languages from the translation plugin, when one is active. It renders nothing otherwise.'=>'Ó ṣe àkójọ àwọn èdè ojú-wọlé láti inú plọ́gìnnì ìtumọ̀, nígbà tí ẹnì kan bá ń ṣiṣẹ́. Kò ní fi ohunkohun hàn bí bẹ́ẹ̀ kọ́.','block keywordlanguage'=>'Èdè','block keywordswitcher'=>'olùyípadà','block titleSample content'=>'Àkọsẹ̀ṣe àpẹẹrẹ','block descriptionA heading and a paragraph, rendered with neutral class names. It is the reference block for the translation contract.'=>'Oríkì kan àti ìpínrọ̀ kan, tí a fi àwọn orúkọ kíláàsì tí kò ní ẹ̀gbẹ́ hàn. Ó jẹ́ bálọ́ọ̀kù ìtọ́kasí fún àdéhùn ìtumọ̀ náà.','block keywordsample'=>'àpẹẹrẹ','block keywordtext'=>'ọ̀rọ̀','block titleIcon'=>'Àwòrán kékeré','block descriptionAn SVG icon. The markup is cleaned before it is shown.'=>'Àwòrán SVG kan. A ti sọ àmì náà di mímọ́ kí a tó fi hàn.','block keywordicon'=>'àmì-ìdánimọ̀','block keywordsvg'=>'svg','block titleRow'=>'Ahọnni','block descriptionA row of columns. Stays readable if the plugin is ever turned off.'=>'Ọ̀wọ́ àwọn kọlọmù. Ó máa ń wa ní ẹ̀ka tí ó ṣe é kà bí a bá pa plọ́gìn (plugin) náà tì láé.','block keywordrow'=>'igboro','block keywordcolumns'=>'àwọn Òpó','block titleShortcode (add-on)'=>'Koodu kukuru (afikun)','block descriptionA shortcode from an add-on written for the classic Page Builder Sandwich editor, with the settings the add-on declared.'=>'Ṣọ́tíkò láti inú àfikún kan tí a kọ fún olootu Page Builder Sandwich ti ìbílẹ̀, pẹ̀lú àwọn ètò tí àfikún náà kéde.','block keywordshortcode'=>'koodu kukuru','block keywordadd-on'=>'fún-ún-ṣe','block titleWidget area'=>'Agbègbè Widget','block descriptionShows the widgets in one of the theme\'s widget areas.'=>'Ó fi àwọn widget hàn ní ọ̀kan lára àwọn agbègbè widget ti tiimu náà.','block keywordsidebar'=>'apadi ẹgbẹ','block keywordwidget area'=>'agbègbè wígìtì','block titleWidget'=>'Wọ́gìtì','block descriptionShows one of the site\'s registered classic widgets.'=>'Ó fi ọ̀kan nínú àwọn wídìgì (widgets) aláìlẹ́gbẹ́ ti ojú opó wẹ́bù hàn.','block keywordwidget'=>'widijeti']];